From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 10:17:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(agents): a guard and the thing it guards must live on
 the same branch

New vacuity class. Every prior instance -- _ROOT one level short, the
uncovered session expiry, five tests passing against a nonexistent
directory -- was inside a single tree. This one is a property of the
branch topology: test_attest__the_reference_credential_store_is_empty
guards configs/kvmd/webauthn.json, which exists only on
claude/glkvm-webauthn, so the guard skips here and the skip reads as a
pass. Nothing currently checks for the split.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NqivnLpopLHdyL62k5JaJx
---
 AGENTS.md | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/AGENTS.md b/AGENTS.md
index 7e9abf5..77246f4 100644
--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -55,6 +55,13 @@ surface. It does not remove binaries, services, or boot behaviour.
 - **Restore from a snapshot, not from git.** `git checkout -- <path>` discards
   uncommitted work, and `git checkout <sha> -- <path>` *stages* what it restores.
   Copy the file aside before mutating it.
+- **A guard and the thing it guards must live on the same branch.** Otherwise
+  the guard is vacuous, and it is vacuous in the direction that reads as a pass.
+  `test_attest__the_reference_credential_store_is_empty` skips wherever
+  `configs/kvmd/webauthn.json` is absent, which is every branch but
+  `claude/glkvm-webauthn` — so on this branch it certifies nothing. Every other
+  vacuity found so far was inside a single tree; this class is a property of the
+  branch topology, and nothing checks it.
 - **Claim the environment you actually ran.** `testenv/tox.ini` declares
   `basepython = python3.12`; a bare `python3` here is 3.11. Both are staged and
   both pass — but say which, and name the dependency set, because a missing test
